OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as police investigate sex
OL,4,Aassault at nightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating a sexual assault
OL,7,Fin the toilets of a nightclub in Derby
OL,8,Fhave made an arrest.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said the incident
OL,11,Foccurred at MooMoo in St James's Street
OL,12,Fin the early hours of Saturday, when a
OL,13,Fwoman was allegedly assaulted by a man.
OL,15,FA 19-year-old man was arrested in
OL,16,Fconnection with the incident, and has
OL,17,Fsince been released on bail while
OL,18,Finvestigations continue.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
